    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Vincent Edwards \"Vince\" Phillips (born July 23, 1963) is an American former professional boxer who competed from 1989 to 2007. He held the IBF junior welterweight title from 1997 to 1999, notably scoring an upset victory against then-undefeated Kostya Tszyu to become champion.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9999999959563598,
